              "summary": "project:fact - [tags: rust testing mutex deadlock kimetsu-brain] When a Rust test uses `with_user_brain_disabled(|| { ... })`, do NOT call `test_env_lock().lock()` inside the closure — `with_user_brain_disabled` already acquires that same non-reentrant `std::sync::Mutex`, causing an immediate deadlock. Simply save/restore extra env vars directly inside the closure; the outer lock already serializes all env mutation."
            },
