              "summary": "project:fact - [tags: ci flaky tests quarantine nextest rust] Flaky tests poison CI signal — a 5% flake rate means 40% of runs see at least one failure in a 10-test suite. quarantine flaky tests with `#[ignore]` + a tracking issue, OR run them in a separate job with `continue-on-error: true`. `cargo nextest` supports a `--flaky-test-retries N` flag to auto-retry and mark retried tests in output."
