              "summary": "project:fact - [2026-09-07] [tags: kimetsu mcp remote bridge host-integration] Kimetsu remote-MCP host wiring shapes (for `kimetsu plugin install --remote`): Claude Code `.mcp.json` remote server = {\"type\":\"http\",\"url\":\"<base>/mcp/<repo>\",\"headers\":{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer <tok>\"}} under both `mcpServers` and `servers`. OpenClaw `openclaw.json` = mcp.servers.kimetsu {\"url\":...,\"transport\":\"streamable-http\",\"headers\":{\"Authorization\":...}}. Default the token to the literal string `${KIMETSU_REMOTE_TOKEN}` (both hosts expand ${VAR} in config) so the secret isn't written to disk; --token writes a literal."
            }
