              "summary": "project:fact - [tags: git sparse-checkout partial-clone bandwidth] `git sparse-checkout init --cone` combined with `git clone --filter=blob:none` (partial clone) fetches only the commit graph and tree objects, not blobs. Individual blobs are fetched on demand when accessed. This cuts clone time for large repos from minutes to seconds."
            },
            {
