              "summary": "project:fact - [tags: aws credentials chain env iam instance-profile] AWS SDK and kimetsu's hand-rolled SigV4 both resolve credentials in a chain: (1) `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`+`AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`+`AWS_SESSION_TOKEN` env vars, (2) `~/.aws/credentials` named profile (`AWS_PROFILE` or `[default]`), (3) EC2 instance metadata (169.254.169.254), (4) ECS task credentials (via `AWS_CONTAINER_CREDENTIALS_RELATIVE_URI`). kimetsu reads ONLY env vars (step 1). If you need profile or instance role support, load the file manually."
            },
            {
